## Tools

- **context-mode** (`mcp__plugin_context-mode_context-mode__ctx_execute` / `ctx_execute_file` /
  `ctx_batch_execute`) — use instead of Bash for any command with large output: `{{BUILD_CMD}}`,
  `{{TEST_CMD}}`{{FORMAT_CMD_INLINE}}, dependency analysis. Only the summary enters context. Bare Bash
  only for `git`, `mkdir`, `rm`, `mv`, navigation.
